      en: ["Located in the Mafeteng District at an elevation of about 1600 meters.", "Situated in close proximity to the border with South Africa.", "Key location for the production of maize and wheat in the lowlands.", "Falls under the administrative jurisdiction of the Tsakholo Community Council.", "The climate is semi-arid with hot summers and cool winters.", "The majority of the population relies on subsistence farming for income."],
