      en: ["Established as a Roman Catholic mission in the late 1800s", "Located in the Maseru District on the route to Roma", "Notable for its historic colonial-era sandstone architecture", "Functions as a regional hub for primary and secondary education", "Local economy is driven by subsistence farming and livestock", "Features a temperate climate with cool winters and warm summers"],
