      en: ["Key road junction for the A4 highway.", "Elevation is 1900 meters above sea level.", "Part of the Qacha's Nek District.", "Primary access point for Sehlabathebe Park.", "Historically strategic for southeast trade.", "Surrounded by volcanic mountain landscapes."],
